{"author":["Elastic","Massimo Bertocchi"],"description":"检测macOS创建或修改emond规则。对应需求：持久化。官方：Emond Rules Creation or Modification。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-endpoint.events.file*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】macOS创建或修改emond规则","references":["https://www.xorrior.com/emond-persistence/","https://www.sentinelone.com/blog/how-malware-persists-on-macos/"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"a6bf4dd4-743e-4da8-8c03-3ebd753a6c90","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 macOS 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: macOS","主题: 持久化","来源: 默认","对应需求: 持久化"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"file where host.os.type == \"macos\" and event.action == \"modification\" and\n file.path like (\"/private/etc/emond.d/rules/*.plist\", \"/etc/emond.d/rules/*.plist\", \"/private/var/db/emondClients/*\")\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nmacOS创建或修改emond规则\n\n### 为何重要\n在重启或登录后保持立足点\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1546","name":"Event Triggered Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1546/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1546.014","name":"Emond","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1546/014/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0003","name":"Persistence","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0003/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1546","name":"Event Triggered Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1546/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1546.014","name":"Emond","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1546/014/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0004","name":"Privilege Escalation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0004/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":115,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
